[version]
1.6.1
[date]
2026-10-22
[whatsnew]
- FIXED: "Move to Monitor" now works properly!
  - Window:_resume() now redirects to monitor.wrap (not just window)
  - Context menu shows list of attached monitors with sizes
  - "Send to <side>" redirects output to that monitor
  - "Back to main screen" returns to window
  - App output goes to monitor in real-time
- CHANGED: File Manager keys moved from F-keys to number keys
  - 2=Rename  4=Edit  5=Copy  6=Move  7=MkDir  8=Delete
  - Tab=Switch pane  Q=Quit  (same as before)
  - Bottom bar updated to show new key bindings
- ADDED: Mouse support in more GUI apps!
  - Editor: click to move cursor, scroll to page up/down
  - Task Manager: click buttons, click process to select
  - Settings: click categories, click options to toggle/cycle
  - System Manager: click tabs, click list items to select
  - Clock: click anywhere to quit
  - System Monitor: click anywhere to quit
  - Calculator, Paint, GBrowse: already had mouse support
- IMPROVED: Window close button removes window from list immediately
  (was leaving dead windows in the render list)
[/whatsnew]
[files]
de/gui.lua
usr/bin/filemanager.lua
usr/bin/editor.lua
